{
  "about": "What the calculators on /fitness read from the field guide. Each key under data names the guide entry its numbers come from and, for a table, the columns it must still have. scripts/build_fitness.py reads the numbers out of the entry (one parser per key) and stops if the entry goes or its columns or rows change shape, so no guide number is ever retyped in /fitness.js. Only the parsed numbers reach the page, as #tool-data (TOOL_SHIP in the build); a table or entry whose words a tool shows is read from the one copy page.html prints, and the build checks it is printed, once. supplements lists the single entries the supplement checker shows, under the short name a visitor picks; a name that matches a row of the supplement tables joins that row.",
